[DESC:]
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
00_install_prereqs.sh	- installs all needed packages, generates locale,
			  creates swap file in case of need, needs sudo. run once
01_dl_ros_build.sh	- downloads build branch of meta-ros repo with all needed
			  build instructions and configs (not sources). run once
02_build.sh		- downloads all sources and builds working image. rerun
			  every time you do changes. uses 'kas' tool to build
03_flash.sh		- use it with param like 'sda' to flash image onto device,
			  be careful to select proper device! needs sudo
check_swap.sh		- checks and creates a swapfile in case of need. swapfile
			  size needed to use 20 jobs is like 16Gb. needs sudo.
			  (called inside of 00_install_prereqs.sh)

[USAGE:]
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
For a first run use next sequence:
---
./00_install_prereqs.sh
./01_dl_ros_build.sh
./02_build.sh
./03_flash.sh sda

To rebuild image just use:
---
./02_build.sh
./03_flash.sh sda

Be careful to use correct disk name with 03_flash.sh!!!

